From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UseAfterMe <441384+UseAfterMe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:09:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] gl: what FINAL FANTASY VII needs to boot and render
 (eglQuerySurface, uniform blocks, depthless variants)

FINAL FANTASY VII (0100A5B00BDC6000) renders with OpenGL ES through EGL. On this
layer it asserted at startup on an unimplemented eglQuerySurface, so shader
capture got nothing.

- eglQuerySurface: width and height of the backing images, with EGL errors
  that eglGetError now reports and clears.
- Named uniform blocks: glBindBuffer(GL_UNIFORM_BUFFER), glBindBufferBase,
  glBindBufferRange, glGetUniformBlockIndex and glUniformBlockBinding.
  gl_shaders.py records them as B:<name>=<binding>:<size>, and each draw binds
  the indexed buffer to the stage's slot.
- gl_shaders.py: '#version 300/310/320' without 'es' (NVIDIA accepts it) is
  read as ES; textureLodOffset at LOD 0 with an offset passed in a variable
  becomes textureLod with the offset divided by textureSize, like the existing
  textureOffset rewrite. A fragment shader that writes gl_FragDepth gets a
  second function with no depth output (gl_<key>_nd_f), used when the target
  has no depth attachment, where GL drops the write and Metal rejects the
  pipeline (the magenta screen after the splash).
- State queries the game reads back: glIsEnabled, glGetBooleanv (color and
  depth write masks), glBlendColor with GL_BLEND_COLOR, and the blend and
  stencil values of glGetIntegerv.

Tested: t_gl_imports (both modes) and the new test_gl_shaders.py. On a Mac,
the game boots to the title menu, and New Game plays the opening movie into the
first scene: walking, dialog and the first battle render and play, with all 17
captured shaders translated and no crash over a 7.5-minute run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: FINAL FANTASY VII (0100A5B00BDC6000) crashes at startup on eglQuerySurface and needs uniform blocks and depthless shader variants to render
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1287
